   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PERFORMANCE-BASED PARTNERSHIP SCHEME FOCUSING ON QUALITY PROGRAMMING, UNDERSTANDING CHANGE AND RESULTS FOR POOR HOUSEHOLDS AND COMMUNITIES</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ICSP Programme, implemented by Tr&#xF3;caire, contributes to outcome 6.1 Tr&#xF3;caire fulfils its commitment to localisation while inspiring sectoral transformation in solidarity with local actors. The objective is to solidify Tr&#xF3;caire Rwanda&#x2019;s role as a leading actor on localisation and partnership in Rwanda. Key activities include the creation of the Tr&#xF3;caire Rwanda Localization and Partnership Unit, with a clear 5-year strategy; and developing and sharing learning and best practice with external stakeholders.&#xA0;   ----   The principal focus of this outcome is:Partnership and localisation; with a focus on Women Centred Organisations</narrative>
